    "text": "For <math><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> if <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a differentiable function such that <math><mi>x</mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> equals (where <math><mi>C</mi></math> is a constant)",
